# A desktop with a Ryzen APU and a discrete Radeon card, as T-451 needs it: written by hand in the
# shape the kernel uses (amdgpu sysfs and hwmon, k10temp, RAPL through the intel-rapl driver, which
# AMD processors share), NOT captured from a machine. card0 is the APU's own graphics, card1 the
# card the firmware boots with. The RAPL counters are readable here, as for a root reader.
